## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Mythos 5
- **Short description:** Anthropic’s Claude Mythos 5 (released June 9, 2026) is the same underlying model as Claude Fable 5, offered with cybersecurity safeguards lifted for defensive work to organizations verified through Anthropic’s verification programs (e.g. Project Glasswing / Cyber Verification Program). It is positioned for high-stakes cybersecurity and biology research use cases.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic via trusted/verified access programs only (not general public). Claude Platform docs list model ID `claude-mythos-5` with specs/pricing matching Claude Fable 5. Local metadata ID `anthropic/claude-mythos-5`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released June 9, 2026 (Anthropic announcement; platform docs show June 9, 2026). Knowledge/training cutoff not independently extracted as clear standalone values in this pass.
- **IDs:** `claude-mythos-5`.
- **Context window:** 1M tokens context, 128K max output (per platform docs; same as Fable 5).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (per platform docs/meta).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $10 / 1M input tokens, $50 / 1M output tokens (per platform docs/announcement).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Anthropic model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

